  "published": "2026-08-24T11:01:10.5Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- docs: brings the package page up to the version 6 surface and ships the API\n- build: bans the ambient clock, the blocking waits and the wrong encodings\n- build: labels the package groups and floats the analyzer versions\n- build: turns on every code-quality rule for the shipped projects\n- feat: opens the wire layer up to derivation\n- build!: declares the public API and guards it with an analyzer\n- fix!: repairs the version 6 surface and puts its members in order\n- docs: describes the version 6 surface\n- feat(generator)!: derives macro requirements and adds MILT003\n- feat(generator): derives the minimum protocol version a filter needs\n- feat: adds skip for repeatable events\n- feat(generator)!: derives the no-reply event family\n- feat(session): records what the negotiation settled on\n- feat(generator): derives delivery requirements\n- refactor!: splits sender and recipient information\n- feat: adds the version 6 modification actions\n- feat(session): adds quit-for-new-connection\n- feat(negotiation)!: negotiates the protocol version down to what the MTA offers\n- feat: adds the DATA and unknown-command events\n- feat(link)!: adds the version 6 command, response and negotiation flags",
